    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nTucked away to the rear of the highly regarded Beggar's Bush development off Haddington Road, this charming two-bedroom end of terrace townhouse presents a rare opportunity to acquire a private home in one of Dublin 4's most sought-after locations.\n\nOriginally forming part of the historic Beggar's Bush Barracks, the development is full of character and offers well-proportioned accommodation extending over two levels. The ground floor comprises an entrance hall, two double bedrooms, and a modern shower room. Upstairs, a bright and spacious open-plan living, dining and kitchen area benefits from vaulted ceilings, windows on three sides, and access to a private balcony, creating a wonderful sense of light and space throughout. There is also a designated car parking space.\n\nThe property is ideally suited to both owner-occupiers and investors seeking a prime Dublin 4 address in a mature and established setting.\n\nThe location is second to none, within walking distance of Grand Canal Dock, Ballsbridge, Sandymount and the city centre. An excellent selection of cafés, restaurants, shops and recreational amenities are close by, while Grand Canal Dock DART Station and numerous bus routes provide excellent connectivity across the city.\n\nBeggar's Bush remains one of Dublin 4's most desirable residential developments, renowned for its mature landscaped surroundings, peaceful atmosphere and exceptional convenience."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - \n\n\nBedroom 1: - \ndouble room with windows on two sides and fitted wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 2: - \ndouble room with fitted wardrobes.\n\nShower Room: - \nwith step-in shower cubicle, electric shower, wash hand basin with storage beneath, wc, partially tiled walls and tiled floor.\n\nFIRST FLOOR - \n\n\nLanding: - \nwith window.\n\nLiving / Dining Room: - \nbright room with vaulted ceiling, recessed lights, timber floor, mock fireplace and door to balcony.\n\nKitchen: - \nwith fitted wall and floor units, tiled work surfaces, cooker, fridge and washing machine.\n\n"
      },
